[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SSS003
TITLE: Airports inside communications distance shall exchange the state a handoff requires
STATEMENT: >>>
An airport shall treat another airport as a neighbor only when the distance between their configured positions is within the configured communications distance, and it shall exchange handoff requests with such a neighbor. Airports farther apart shall not be offered a handoff. Acceptance is three airports where only the pair inside the distance can complete a handoff.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
Communications distance is the policy that decides who is in the cluster.
<<<
DAL: A
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: System
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: The checked envelope is 4 runways, 8 aircraft under control, and 2 neighbor airports. Visual separation, LAHSO, radar vectoring, TRACON, enroute control, and wake RECAT are outside this increment. Positions are the configured latitude and longitude.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: OCD002
